AGENTS.md
# Ignore generated eval reports — but not the directory itself, otherwise git
# won't descend into it and the negations below can't take effect.
eval/reports/*
# …except the Phase 2 acceptance evidence, which is a committed deliverable
# rather than a throwaway generated report.
!eval/reports/phase2/
eval/reports/phase2/*
!eval/reports/phase2/evidence.md
# …and the Phase 7 acceptance evidence, same deal.
!eval/reports/phase7/
eval/reports/phase7/*
!eval/reports/phase7/evidence.md
eval/predictions*.json
eval/.env
.env
